WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:05.016
Ringo and Lucy hid.

2
00:00:05.017 --> 00:00:10.461
"Space bats are creepy!" Lucy said.

3
00:00:10.462 --> 00:00:15.075
Ringo nodded.

4
00:00:15.076 --> 00:00:20.454
Bot and PJ found Ringo and Lucy.

5
00:00:20.455 --> 00:00:24.461
"You two are silly," PJ said.

6
00:00:24.462 --> 00:00:26.728
"Space bats won't hurt you."

7
00:00:26.729 --> 00:00:31.198
"We must help the trapped miners," Bot said.

8
00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:35.853
Ringo sighed. "You're right."

9
00:00:35.854 --> 00:00:40.932
Lucy took a deep breath.

10
00:00:40.933 --> 00:00:50.484
"Let's go," she said.

11
00:00:50.485 --> 00:00:56.482
Ringo and Lucy followed Bot and PJ.

12
00:00:56.483 --> 00:01:07.115
"I don't see any space bats," Ringo whispered.

13
00:01:07.116 --> 00:01:10.484
"Uh-oh," Bot said.

14
00:01:10.485 --> 00:01:14.721
A big rock blocked the tunnel.

15
00:01:14.722 --> 00:01:18.081
"I'll break the rock apart," PJ said.

16
00:01:18.082 --> 00:01:24.735
His arm turned into a jackhammer.

17
00:01:24.736 --> 00:01:27.373
Brekk-a-brekk-a!

18
00:01:27.374 --> 00:01:31.017
Rock dust filled the tunnel.

19
00:01:31.018 --> 00:01:39.676
Everyone coughed.

20
00:01:39.677 --> 00:01:52.705
Soon the rock was gone.

21
00:01:52.706 --> 00:01:59.479
They walked deeper.

22
00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:06.750
More rocks blocked the tunnel.

23
00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:12.816
PJ started to break them. Brekk-a-brekk-a!

24
00:02:12.817 --> 00:02:16.919
Thick dust filled the tunnel again.

25
00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:22.226
Rumble! Rumble! The tunnel shook.

26
00:02:22.227 --> 00:02:27.759
"Space Patrol, is that you?" a miner called.

27
00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:30.637
"Yes!" Ringo said.

28
00:02:30.638 --> 00:02:35.110
"We're breaking rocks to get to you!"

29
00:02:35.111 --> 00:02:38.657
"Stop doing that!" the miner said.

30
00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:45.541
"The ceiling is cracking!

31
00:02:45.542 --> 00:02:50.858
The whole place will cave in!"

